{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13101190","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13101190","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1310119001:0":{"text":"本がたくさんありますね。ページがボロボロ……きっと本をよく読まれてるんですね。","source_cn":"这里有不少书，书页已经有些旧了……看来法拉莫尔先生经常翻阅。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF025BEBA70E4444F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310119002:0":{"text":"『蘇りし者の呪い』、『恐厄集』、『死の誕生』……それにハードカバーの『命の鎖』も。","source_cn":"《复生者之咒》、《恐厄集》、《死诞之书》……还有精装版...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x696CF9365194B300","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310119003:0":{"text":"どれもグレイヴボーンに関する本です。すごく研究熱心なんですね。","source_cn":"这些书都与亡灵有关，法拉莫尔先生对亡灵的研究的确很深。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98C1DCDE3BDB1BB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310119004:0":{"text":"あれ？この手紙は……ホワイトマウンテン宮殿からの祭典の警備要請、フェルガルドさんはグレイヴボーンハンターだったんですね！","source_cn":"咦？这里有封信……原来法拉莫尔是位亡灵猎人，这次是被白...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7873853983E40F3F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310119005:0":{"text":"こらロンロン！勝手に人の手紙を読んじゃダメでしょ！","source_cn":"满满，怎么能随便看别人的信件呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADBDE533518A3E57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","docum